WEBVTT

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.650
Hmm, perhaps I made the
part configuration too complex.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:15.450
But then, once the memories
of 10,031 deaths arrive,

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.570
I can complete the formula.

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:22.450
Mm-hmm, just a little longer
before our research is complete,

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.290
Hirumi.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.930
This isn't going to cut it. Not this.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.480
Adonai...

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:47.650
Yeah, lay her down right here.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:03.450
She's all right. The life force flowing
through her body is largely undisturbed.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.750
Can you heal her, too?

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:16.180
No, I'm only checking on the state of her body.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:21.560
Even knowing her condition,
all I can do is general first aid.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:26.980
If you hadn't come along, I'm sure
none of us here would have survived.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:28.900
I-I'm grateful.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.690
Tch.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:35.610
Ultimately, I wasn't...
I wasn't able to do anything.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:03.510
"A Certain Scientific Accelerator"

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:15.170
"#07 Download (Time Limit)"

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.420
What are you doing?

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:16.500
These aren't the sort of
people that feel gratitude.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.420
After losing to you, I'm sure they
feel sorry for what they've done.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:22.590
The hell they do.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.850
The way things were headed,
we would have lost our lives before long.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:30.850
You really are incredible.
You save people from death with your power.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.940
I was just stomping on some annoying bugs.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.110
You're wrong.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.360
Huh?

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.780
I can tell by looking at them.
You may have done damage to them,

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.660
but your attacks were not
meant to take their lives.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:47.240
You look and act like
you're wild and unmannered,

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.950
but you still end up helping others.

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:55.630
I couldn't help but come to that conclusion.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.550
Stop coming to your own conclusions.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:00.800
You really are the only one!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.170
Huh?

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:06.220
U-Um, w-would you...

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.520
...b-be my master?

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.020
Huh?

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:15.650
When those of us in the Rosenthal family
make a promise to a teacher,

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.690
our custom is for the pupil

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.480
to present a piece of red clothing
or gear that they are wearing.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.780
It represents an offering of
one's flesh and blood to the master.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:33.370
By adding depth and giving form to it,
it deepens the significance of the blood.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:37.540
Why don't you ask the Antiskill lady
lying over there, instead?

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.550
No, please don't say that! I'm begging you!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:05:01.280
Please! Be my master!
I want to learn your strength!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.900
Huotou, you ask him, too!

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:08.410
As you wish. Carrying out Adonai's order.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:12.080
Accelerator, I request
that you be Adonai's master.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.960
Please, I'm begging you! See?

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:22.090
For that matter, why aren't
you wearing any clothes?

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:26.380
Oh, there wasn't any time.
Our first priority was going after them,

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.090
so we couldn't properly equip ourselves.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:32.720
You're right, the defense
this provides is definitely debatable.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:33.930
I know!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.770
I can just give Huotou <i>my</i> outfit!
That will increase Huotou's defense--

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:41.320
That would prove to be a troubling
decrease to Adonai's defense.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.650
What if I were to borrow Accelerator's clothing?

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:46.820
That makes sense!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:50.450
As the master, you don't need
to rely on clothing for defense.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.080
Very well, if you'd be so kind?

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.080
If you'd be so kind?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.880
Ah! Wait up, Master!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:13.260
I request that you be Adonai's master.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:16.180
You don't have to coach me at all.
I'll learn on my own.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.020
So please, be my master!

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:21.110
I once again request
that you be Adonai's master.

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:24.230
There's a huge difference between
having a master and not having one!

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:27.490
I repeatedly and earnestly request
that you be Adonai's master.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:33.410
Come on, please! I need you to be
my master, whatever it takes! Please!

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.040
Tch, you're such a pest.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:43.920
Please! If we leave them be,
the world will be in dang--

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:51.220
Makes no difference to me
what happens to the world.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:55.930
And if you keep pestering me,
I'll shut you up for good.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.810
I need to stop Hirumi, no matter what!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:07.900
I can't stop Hirumi... the way I am now.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:11.860
I need... I need strength...

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.250
Please!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:23.290
Hmph! You really are a willful girl.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.590
What happened here?!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.840
Tch.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.840
Hey, you're bleeding.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:33.300
Misaka suggests the need for first aid.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.680
Huotou agrees.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.640
Huh? Hey...

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.560
Come on, make this easy.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.140
Come on, now.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:44.480
Ah, Master, where are you going?!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.820
What you want is none of my concern,

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:51.530
but Hishigata, was it?
That guy rubs me the wrong way.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.070
I'm going to find him, and crush him.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.490
Then let me come with you!

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.200
Suit yourself.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.620
Huh?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.790
What is that?!

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.930
Those are Rosenthal magical arrays.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.350
That's Taotie.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:17.850
Huh?

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:19.390
Taotie?

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:22.690
A Si-xiong charm much
more powerful than Huotou.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:25.350
Keep back! I'm the one they're after! I'll--

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.360
You keep back, too.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.070
Isn't this convenient?

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:32.780
I don't have to go looking for leads
when the leads come to me.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:33.900
Wait a second!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:37.910
We still don't know which abilities
he's enhanced! Be careful--

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.700
Master!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.050
Accelerator!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:58.720
Hmph.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:02.020
The ability to switch places--"Replace."

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.480
Are you all right?!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.400
Tch.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:16.320
Do you think you can beat me
two against one, you evasive bastard?

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.700
Huh? Nothing to say today?

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.080
Stay out of this.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.160
A girl?

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:26.500
Hirumi...

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.090
Stop doing this, already!

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.460
Return Hirumi!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.510
Adonai, are you all right?

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:44.060
Are you trying to get killed?

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.430
What is that?!

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.310
Tch, another corpse ability?

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:54.150
Now there are <i>three</i> of them.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.870
Let the girl go!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.040
Tch, <i>that's</i> what you're after?!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:25.390
That was pretty sneaky of you, huh?

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.940
See you around, Esther.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.190
You think you're getting away?!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.740
Huotou, can you pursue?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.860
That would be difficult.
Given the extent of these flames,

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:47.040
70% of my body would suffer burns,
and my mobility would drop below 50%.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.500
If I were to catch up, the chances
of me stopping that much mass are--

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:50.960
Okay, enough!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.420
Don't do anything rash!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:58.090
Adonai, there is one chance of success.
Shall I execute your order?

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:06.270
I'm rescinding my order.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.520
I see, and reinforcements?

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.990
Copy that. Currently standing by.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:23.200
I know I saw your dead body, Hitokawa Hasami.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.330
How are you alive?

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.250
She isn't.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.080
"Hitokawa Hasami"

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:38.670
Hitokawa Hasami is dead.
A pseudo-soul is just moving her body about.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.920
Pseudo-soul?

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:45.180
An artificially-created soul,
I guess you could call it.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.810
For generations, the Rosenthal family line

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:52.140
have been necromancers, commanding
the bodies of the dead as our livelihood.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.940
Commanding dead bodies?

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.020
You don't believe me?

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:01.320
I don't understand the how,
but I can't deny what I see.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:06.280
A person who should be dead
is actually up and moving around.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:11.040
So, what do you have to do with
those huge ability-using weapons?

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:15.790
I have to put a stop to them.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:30.310
That's amazing, Hirumi! You can do that, too?

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.890
Right? I didn't know it, myself!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.770
That being said, we can't have this--

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:39.610
moving coffins around
without permission... Hmm?

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:41.990
You got the Sister?!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:46.200
Nice going, Hirumi!
That's fantastic! Leave it to you!

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:51.660
All right! Leave the rest to me! Mm-hmm...

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.370
Wait, huh?

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:03.420
I see. So the reason she
was put into that big weapon

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:07.140
was because this "necromancy"
business was used on her?

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:10.720
That's right. A kind developed
by Hishigata and myself.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:13.640
Hishigata Mikihiko, huh?

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.850
So he's the one behind all of this?

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:20.770
Does that mean those other weapons
earlier are controlled by necromancy?

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:25.740
Those are even more dangerous.
They use the Evil Spirits of the Numbers.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.120
Evil Spirits of the Numbers?

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:31.830
Qiongqi, Hundun, and Taotie...

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.540
Special pseudo-souls, which have
been fine-tuned for generations,

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.380
since their creation by
our fifth family head, Nathan.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:42.590
Stronger than her? I'm plenty
surprised by how strong <i>she</i> is.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:45.720
Bodies that have had an Evil Spirits
of the Numbers charm performed on them

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:49.550
demonstrate power greatly in excess
of the potential the body possesses.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:53.140
But it's difficult for an ordinary
necromancer to control it.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.270
"Qiongqi"

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.890
Let alone Hishigata,
who isn't even a necromancer.

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:56.270
"Hundun"

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:58.810
For him to keep using them
is extremely dangerous.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.270
"Taotie"

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:02.940
There are stories of them losing control,
and destroying whole towns.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.700
You don't say.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.110
Bad news, huh?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:22.540
Well, if it isn't Accelerator! Mm-hmm.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.680
So these piles of junk have
switched drivers, have they?

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:29.890
Ah, "piles of junk" is mean.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:33.140
Unlike the prototype that you destroyed,

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:36.890
these three have pseudo-souls boosting
their abilities up to Level-5 class.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:40.980
Mm-hmm, you may be the
first-ranked esper in Academy City...

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:49.360
You're really annoying me. Just tell me
where you are, already, you shut-in.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:52.570
I'll tear your body apart.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.240
You're pretty sure of yourself.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:58.870
I thought you had your hands pretty
full with just Qiongqi last time.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.380
Mm-hmm, so go ahead and wreck it.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:04.090
You small potatoes are always
quick to get too full of yourselves!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:13.350
Told you so! Psychokinesis
has greater versatility than you do!

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:17.350
Ultimately, your vector manipulation
must rely on some medium.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:23.520
Without direct contact, it's no different
than any other physical phenomenon!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.270
Whoa!

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:29.860
I don't care if you are using
psychokinesis, or anything else,

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:33.700
as long as there's a force at work,
then it will have vectors, too.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:38.410
Don't fool yourself. No matter how
many Level-5 class piles of junk you have,

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.000
it doesn't mean a thing.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:44.290
I am still the first-ranked.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.670
Amazing! Amazing! Mm-hmm!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:50.340
The low-level espers I used
in my experiments are trash!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:53.680
Yeah! I want to put him into a coffin!

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:57.260
Once I do, I'm sure something
amazing will happen!

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.270
Brother?

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.310
Come on.

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:10.110
Yeah, all right, Hirumi. First we have
to achieve our goal. Mm-hmm.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:15.660
So, what should I destroy next?
An arm? The other leg?

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.710
Huh? I thought this was one on one.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.330
Oh, sorry about that.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.750
You have a lower priority level,

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:30.010
but I'm so delighted by our reunion,
I couldn't help but butt in here.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:34.510
Mm-hmm, I'll get back to my original objective.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:37.680
Don't you dart off wherever you like!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:50.860
Ah, too bad! The prime field
ability installed within Hundun

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:54.110
creates "Stealth Hide," which dulls
the senses of humans around it.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.160
The ability is boosted by the coffin,

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:59.330
making it able to completely
inhibit any and all recognition!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.830
Mm-hmm, isn't that incredible?

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:06.960
She does look alive, that's all I can say.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.250
That was my mistake.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:14.760
Hishigata and I both believed it.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.840
Actually, though, I knew the truth.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.970
I have to put a stop to this.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:25.020
You can't leave that up
to those of us in Antiskill?

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:28.810
I sowed this seed, and now Master,
who has nothing to do with this, is involved.

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:31.730
Leaving it in yet someone else's hands...

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.110
...is impossible.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.790
Why are there so many kids in Academy City

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.210
who take everything on themselves?

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:57.630
Huotou, I hate to ask, but could
you accompany me a little while longer?

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:00.140
As you wish, Adonai.

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:04.640
I'm sorry to you, too, Hitokawa.
This really is the last time.

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:09.310
Once this is over, I'm through with necromancy.

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:17.950
Copying over the memories of
10,031 deaths will soon be complete.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:21.580
Mm-hmm, once I download the
formula that incorporates them,

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:26.410
you'll have your hands on
the perfect ability. Won't you?

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:31.130
I really would have rather had the data
from Last Order, the host individual.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:37.470
I'm sorry about that. Mm-hmm,
I had no idea DA would be so useless.

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:41.220
Hey, now, Hirumi, I was saving
the avocado-flavored one!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.390
Oh, sorry.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.810
Hmm? He just doesn't give up, mm-mm.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:54.150
You'll never catch Hundun
by running around randomly.

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:57.570
Then why are they still following me?

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.700
You want me to answer that?

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:03.870
It's because I'm right on
the trail of your pile of junk!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.620
However invisible something may be,
as long as there's a physical presence,

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:13.500
it will still create motion and air currents.

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:17.010
Calculating those allows me
to pinpoint its location.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.880
You surprise me.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:23.100
My ability is pretty versatile, too.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:25.640
Mm-hmm, you really are amazing!

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.810
As a reward, I think I'll return
the Sister to you unharmed.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:29.940
Huh?!

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:35.360
You are a funny one. Mm-hmm,
getting so worked up and coming this far

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:39.650
for a single clone that you
could create any number of.

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:47.040
What's more, she's left over from those
10,031 clones that you killed, isn't she?

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:52.960
I saw the records. "Level 6 Shift," was it?

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.790
Don't tell me that after
chewing through so many of them,

00:19:55.790 --> 00:20:00.550
you're now trying to play the hero
to save just one of them, are you?

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:05.430
I don't understand why you're
so concerned in the first place.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:08.850
Those guys were originally...

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:13.310
...guinea pigs that were created
for you to kill, weren't they?!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.190
What...

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:19.070
...are you talking about? I...

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:22.150
...have simply...

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:29.080
...made up my mind to
snap every bone in your body!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:33.460
Such a dreadful thing to say.
Mm-hmm, well, negotiations have broken down,

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:36.710
so the guinea pig gets
treated like a guinea pig...

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:40.760
...and I'll use her in one of my experiments!

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:49.310
Keep on jabbering! I'm not about
to give you enough time to do so!

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.270
Whoa, that's some tremendous force, mm-hmm.

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:01.940
I'm going to have to get out of there,
or there really will be trouble.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:16.960
Adonai, are we not going
after those three large weapons?

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:20.460
If all we do is go after them,
we'll just get in Master's way.

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
I will do what I can on my own.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:42.070
Mm-hmm, I'm not sure why,
but he seems pretty angry.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.950
Do you think he'll actually catch up?

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.660
Will we make it? Will we make it?

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:50.410
I just don't know, mm-mm.

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:53.080
I have to make sure that Hishigata and Hirumi...

00:21:56.170 --> 00:22:00.000
...are stopped. Everything that's happened...

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.470
...has happened because I came to this city.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:37.430
"Next time"

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:41.480
"Friend"
